OL,3,GNEWSAIrish government denies           
OL,4,A'foot-dragging' over Omagh Bombing     
OL,5,AInquiry                                
OL,7,FThe Irish government has denied        
OL,8,F"foot-dragging" over the Omagh Bombing 
OL,9,FInquiry, following calls from some     
OL,10,Fvictims' families for the Republic of  
OL,11,FIreland to hold its own investigation. 
OL,13,FThe inquiry is examining whether the   
OL,14,Fattack on 15 August 1998, in which 29  
OL,15,Fpeople including a woman pregnant with 
OL,16,Ftwins were killed, could have been     
OL,17,Fprevented.                             
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
